/// A header block for `headers`, names in lower case: a header the
/// static table holds whole is its index; one whose name it holds, that
/// index and the value; any other, both as text. Text is Huffman-coded
/// where that is shorter. Nothing goes into the dynamic table.
pub fn encode(headers: [Header]) -> Bytes { … }

/// `s` as a string literal: its length, then its bytes, Huffman-coded
/// (the length's top bit set) when that is shorter.
